         Row 4 ("enter the DC1 door and look for the silent judge"): the arena manager Garm teleports
         the player into the Shadow Court instance and the journal row advances by exactly one step;
         the legacy handler jumped 3 -> 5, so the client's fifth row never lit up. -->
